--- !u!114 &900878122
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 900878120}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 0
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "HOW LOW CAN SIX TONS GO?\nDrive with your assigned movement controls.
    Reverse brakes first. Hold ACTION to lower the real NWH suspension; release to
    recover. Left/right gently steer AND lean the actual truck body. Compression
    and lean change the real body pose, not a decorative fake cab. Time your crouch
    near the bar: holding it for more than 2.5 seconds gradually exhausts the pressure
    reserve.\n\nClear the ENTIRE truck under a physical limbo pole. Touching or displacing
    it fails the attempt; going around, jumping over, or escaping the course does
    not count. Each course resolves independently. A generous 35-second limit resolves
    a genuine stalled attempt as a failure. Pause and reconnect preserve every truck
    and bar.\n\nELIMINATION: failed trucks leave after the round. Survivors face
    a lower bar until one remains. Everyone failing together compares best cleared
    height, then points; exact ties share victory. SOLO continues until failure or
    the ninth height. BEST HEIGHT keeps everyone for five increasingly low rounds.\n\n100
    points per clear, +25 for each lower round, +25 for less than 12cm roof clearance,
    +25 for a controlled 12\u201365 degree lean below 4.5m/s. These are visible physical
    outcomes. Lowest cleared height ranks first. All AI uses the same controls, suspension
    and solid bar contacts. Four local humans maximum; AI fills up to eight. Optional
    AI cameras affect presentation only. Offline party physics."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: be1034cebd9fa3643a48d11ef76e4708, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -7304394381272760782, guid: 8e8f97682e668e94cb30d2e6b8e13d84,
    type: 2}
  m_fontSharedMaterials: []
  m_fontMaterial: {fileID: 0}
  m_fontMaterials: []
